*> Contract test, provider side (specs/002-client-polish/contracts/formats-api.md): the programs that exist
*> after the move return the documented values for the hand-made fixtures of contract/fixtures/formats:
*> JSON-PARSE/-FIND/-MEMBER/-ELEMENT/-STRING/-KEY, UTF8-ENCODE/-DECODE, ZIP-OPEN/-COUNT/-NAME/-FIND/-SIZE/
*> -READ/-CLOSE, PNG-DECODE, REGEX-FIND and FILE-READ-ALL, and (Phase 8) CRC32, SHA256-*, FILE-READ-AT,
*> ZIP-CRC-CHECK and the vectors of docs/protocol/22 section 12: T2 (the SHA-256 routine returns the
*> FIPS value for abc, and the jar's digest), T3 (the CRC-32 check value and the CRC of version.json
*> read from the jar) and T15 (the zip reader opens Faithful, 5300 entries, and reads pack.mcmeta and
*> stone.png with the CRC-32 of the central record). The jar and Faithful are the operator's inputs
*> (tmp/, or COBOLCRAFT_INPUTS): a missing file fails the case with its path.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. CONTRACT-FORMATS-PROVIDER.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY JSONDOC.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-PATH                PIC X(1100).
 01 WS-PATH-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FILE                PIC X(4096).
 01 WS-FILE-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NODE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NODE2               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OUT                 PIC X(512).
 01 WS-OUT-LENGTH          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CAP                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 512.
 01 WS-ZIP                 USAGE POINTER.
 01 WS-COUNT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-INDEX               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(256).
 01 WS-NAME-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SIZE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-AREA                PIC X(4000).
 01 WS-LENGTH              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PNG                 PIC X(4096).
 01 WS-PNG-LENGTH          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RGBA                PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-RGBA-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PIXELS              PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-WIDTH               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-HEIGHT              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MATCHED             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ERROR               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PAT                 PIC X(128).
 01 WS-SUBJ                PIC X(256).
 01 WS-CP                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POS                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SHOWN               PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-SHOWN2              PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-C4096               BINARY-LONG VALUE 4096.
 01 WS-C4000               BINARY-LONG VALUE 4000.
 01 WS-C1024               BINARY-LONG VALUE 1024.
 01 WS-C10                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 10.
 COPY FORMATS.
 01 WS-CRC                 BINARY-LONG UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-CRC-D               PIC 9(10).
 01 WS-INPUT               PIC X(64).
 01 WS-INPUT-LENGTH        BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BLOCK               PIC X(65536).
 01 WS-BLOCK-LENGTH        BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OFFSET              BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 WS-HEX                 PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-DIGEST-LENGTH       BINARY-LONG VALUE 32.
 01 WS-BIG                 PIC X(1048576).
 01 WS-C1M                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1048576.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
*>   FILE-READ-ALL, then the strict-enough lenient reader over doc.json.
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-PATH
     MOVE "contract/fixtures/formats/doc.json" TO WS-PATH
     MOVE 34 TO WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "FILE-READ-ALL" USING WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-FILE WS-C4096 WS-FILE-LENGTH WS-STATUS
     MOVE "contract formats FILE-READ-ALL reads doc.json: status 0, 30 bytes" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 30 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-FILE-LENGTH TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0
         MOVE -1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

     CALL "JSON-PARSE" USING JSON-DOC WS-FILE WS-FILE-LENGTH
     MOVE "contract formats JSON-PARSE of doc.json: no error" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE JD-ERROR TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

     MOVE "a[2]" TO WS-PATH
     MOVE 4 TO WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "JSON-FIND" USING JSON-DOC WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-NODE
     CALL "JSON-STRING" USING JSON-DOC WS-NODE WS-OUT WS-CAP WS-OUT-LENGTH
     MOVE "contract formats JSON-FIND a[2] and JSON-STRING give x" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "x" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     IF WS-OUT-LENGTH > 0
         MOVE WS-OUT(1:WS-OUT-LENGTH) TO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

     MOVE "b.nothing" TO WS-PATH
     MOVE 9 TO WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "JSON-FIND" USING JSON-DOC WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-NODE
     MOVE "contract formats JSON-FIND of an absent member gives node 0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-NODE TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

     MOVE "a" TO WS-PATH
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "JSON-FIND" USING JSON-DOC WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-NODE
     MOVE 2 TO WS-INDEX
     CALL "JSON-ELEMENT" USING JSON-DOC WS-NODE WS-INDEX WS-NODE2
     CALL "JSON-STRING" USING JSON-DOC WS-NODE2 WS-OUT WS-CAP WS-OUT-LENGTH
     MOVE "contract formats JSON-ELEMENT 2 (0-based) of a is the string x" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-OUT-LENGTH TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

     MOVE 1 TO WS-NODE
     MOVE "b" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 1 TO WS-NAME-LENGTH
     CALL "JSON-MEMBER" USING JSON-DOC WS-NODE WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-NODE2
     MOVE "contract formats JSON-MEMBER b of the root is a node" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     IF WS-NODE2 > 0
         MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     ELSE
         MOVE 0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

     MOVE 0 TO WS-OUT-LENGTH
     CALL "JSON-KEY" USING JSON-DOC WS-NODE2 WS-OUT WS-CAP WS-OUT-LENGTH
     MOVE "contract formats JSON-KEY of the member b is b" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "b" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     IF WS-OUT-LENGTH > 0
         MOVE WS-OUT(1:WS-OUT-LENGTH) TO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   UTF-8: U+20AC is E2 82 AC and decodes back.
     MOVE 8364 TO WS-CP
     CALL "UTF8-ENCODE" USING WS-CP WS-OUT WS-LENGTH
     CALL "TEST-HEX-OF" USING WS-OUT WS-LENGTH WS-AREA
     MOVE "contract formats UTF8-ENCODE of U+20AC is e282ac" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "e282ac" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-AREA(1:6) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-POS
     MOVE 3 TO WS-OUT-LENGTH
     CALL "UTF8-DECODE" USING WS-OUT WS-OUT-LENGTH WS-POS WS-CP
     MOVE "contract formats UTF8-DECODE of e282ac is 8364, position 4" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 8364 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-CP TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   Zip: basic.zip.
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-PATH
     MOVE "contract/fixtures/formats/basic.zip" TO WS-PATH
     MOVE 35 TO WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "ZIP-OPEN" USING WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-ZIP WS-STATUS
     MOVE "contract formats ZIP-OPEN of basic.zip: status 0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-STATUS TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ZIP-COUNT" USING WS-ZIP WS-COUNT
     MOVE "contract formats ZIP-COUNT of basic.zip is 4" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 4 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-INDEX
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-NAME
     CALL "ZIP-NAME" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH
     MOVE "contract formats ZIP-NAME of entry 1 is pack.mcmeta" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "pack.mcmeta" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-NAME(1:WS-NAME-LENGTH) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "assets/cobolcraft/lang/en_us.json" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 33 TO WS-NAME-LENGTH
     CALL "ZIP-FIND" USING WS-ZIP WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-INDEX
     CALL "ZIP-SIZE" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-SIZE
     MOVE "contract formats ZIP-FIND and ZIP-SIZE of the lang entry: entry 3, 3000 bytes" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "3 3000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-INDEX TO WS-SHOWN
     MOVE WS-SIZE TO WS-SHOWN2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "pack.mcmeta" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 11 TO WS-NAME-LENGTH
     CALL "ZIP-FIND" USING WS-ZIP WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-INDEX
     CALL "ZIP-READ" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-AREA WS-C4000 WS-LENGTH WS-STATUS
     MOVE "contract formats ZIP-READ of pack.mcmeta: status 0, 53 bytes, the pack JSON" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE '0 53 {"pack":{"pack_format":97,' TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-LENGTH TO WS-SHOWN
     MOVE WS-STATUS TO WS-SHOWN2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN2) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) " " WS-AREA(1:26)
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 10 TO WS-LENGTH
     CALL "ZIP-READ" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-AREA WS-C10 WS-LENGTH WS-STATUS
     MOVE "contract formats ZIP-READ with a capacity below the size is status 5" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 5 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-STATUS TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ZIP-CLOSE" USING WS-ZIP
     MOVE "contract formats ZIP-CLOSE sets the handle NULL" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     IF WS-ZIP = NULL
         MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   PNG: g8.png decodes to the bytes of g8.rgba.
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-PATH
     MOVE "contract/fixtures/formats/g8.png" TO WS-PATH
     MOVE 32 TO WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "FILE-READ-ALL" USING WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-PNG WS-C4096 WS-PNG-LENGTH WS-STATUS
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-PATH
     MOVE "contract/fixtures/formats/g8.rgba" TO WS-PATH
     MOVE 33 TO WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "FILE-READ-ALL" USING WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-RGBA WS-C1024 WS-RGBA-LENGTH WS-STATUS
     CALL "PNG-DECODE" USING WS-PNG WS-PNG-LENGTH WS-PIXELS WS-C1024 WS-WIDTH WS-HEIGHT WS-STATUS
     MOVE "contract formats PNG-DECODE of g8.png: status 0, size 13x11, the reference RGBA" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "0 13x11 same" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-WIDTH TO WS-SHOWN
     MOVE WS-HEIGHT TO WS-SHOWN2
     IF WS-PIXELS(1:572) = WS-RGBA(1:572) AND WS-RGBA-LENGTH = 572
         STRING "0 " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) "x" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN2) " same"
             DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     ELSE
         STRING "differs " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) "x" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN2)
             DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   Regex: the pack.mcmeta filter shape.
     MOVE "\.png$" TO WS-PAT
     MOVE "block/stone.png" TO WS-SUBJ
     MOVE 6 TO WS-LENGTH
     MOVE 15 TO WS-SIZE
     CALL "REGEX-FIND" USING WS-PAT WS-LENGTH WS-SUBJ WS-SIZE WS-MATCHED WS-ERROR
     MOVE "contract formats REGEX-FIND of \.png$ on block/stone.png matches, no error" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = WS-MATCHED - WS-ERROR
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   T3: the CRC-32 check value, through the zip CRC routine.
     MOVE "123456789" TO WS-AREA
     MOVE 9 TO WS-LENGTH
     MOVE 0 TO WS-CRC
     CALL "CRC32" USING WS-AREA WS-LENGTH WS-CRC
     MOVE "contract formats T3 CRC32 of 123456789 is cbf43926" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 3421780262 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-CRC TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   T2: the SHA-256 routine returns the FIPS 180-4 value for abc.
     MOVE "abc" TO WS-AREA
     MOVE 3 TO WS-LENGTH
     CALL "SHA256-INIT" USING FMSHA
     CALL "SHA256-UPDATE" USING FMSHA WS-AREA WS-LENGTH
     CALL "SHA256-FINAL" USING FMSHA FMSHA-DIGEST
     CALL "TEST-HEX-OF" USING FMSHA-DIGEST WS-DIGEST-LENGTH WS-HEX
     MOVE "contract formats T2 SHA256 of abc is ba7816bf...15ad" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "ba7816bf8f01cfea414140de5dae2223b00361a396177a9cb410ff61f20015ad" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-HEX(1:64) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   T2: the jar's SHA-256, the file read in 64 KiB blocks at offsets (FILE-READ-AT).
     MOVE "minecraft-26.3-client.jar" TO WS-INPUT
     CALL "TEST-INPUT-PATH" USING WS-INPUT WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "SHA256-INIT" USING FMSHA
     MOVE 0 TO WS-OFFSET WS-STATUS
     MOVE 65536 TO WS-BLOCK-LENGTH
     PERFORM UNTIL WS-BLOCK-LENGTH < 65536 OR WS-STATUS NOT = 0
         MOVE 65536 TO WS-BLOCK-LENGTH
         CALL "FILE-READ-AT" USING WS-PATH WS-OFFSET WS-BLOCK WS-BLOCK-LENGTH WS-STATUS
         IF WS-STATUS = 0
             CALL "SHA256-UPDATE" USING FMSHA WS-BLOCK WS-BLOCK-LENGTH
             ADD 65536 TO WS-OFFSET
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "SHA256-FINAL" USING FMSHA FMSHA-DIGEST
     CALL "TEST-HEX-OF" USING FMSHA-DIGEST WS-DIGEST-LENGTH WS-HEX
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "contract formats T2 SHA-256 of " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PATH) " is 4508d006...9a2d"
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE "4508d006323f24fa02876310c192d739af56516eb259000ac50f0909a68c9a2d" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-HEX(1:64) TO TL-OBSERVED
     IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0
         MOVE WS-STATUS TO WS-SHOWN
         STRING "FILE-READ-AT status " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   T3: the CRC-32 of the 422 bytes of version.json, read from the jar.
     CALL "ZIP-OPEN" USING WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-ZIP WS-STATUS
     MOVE "version.json" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 12 TO WS-NAME-LENGTH
     MOVE 0 TO WS-INDEX
     IF WS-STATUS = 0
         CALL "ZIP-FIND" USING WS-ZIP WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-INDEX
     END-IF
     MOVE 0 TO WS-LENGTH WS-CRC
     MOVE 1 TO WS-ERROR
     IF WS-INDEX > 0
         CALL "ZIP-READ-RANGE" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-BIG WS-C1M WS-LENGTH WS-ERROR
         CALL "CRC32" USING WS-BIG WS-LENGTH WS-CRC
     END-IF
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "contract formats T3 version.json of " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PATH)
         " is 422 bytes with CRC-32 68d6e8ca" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "0 422 1758914762" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-ERROR TO WS-SHOWN
     MOVE WS-LENGTH TO WS-SHOWN2
     MOVE WS-CRC TO WS-CRC-D
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN2) " " WS-CRC-D DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ZIP-CLOSE" USING WS-ZIP

*>   T15: the zip reader on Faithful.
     MOVE "Faithful 32x - 26.3.zip" TO WS-INPUT
     CALL "TEST-INPUT-PATH" USING WS-INPUT WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH
     CALL "ZIP-OPEN" USING WS-PATH WS-PATH-LENGTH WS-ZIP WS-STATUS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT
     IF WS-STATUS = 0
         CALL "ZIP-COUNT" USING WS-ZIP WS-COUNT
     END-IF
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "contract formats T15 ZIP-OPEN of " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PATH) ": status 0, 5300 entries"
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "0 5300" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-STATUS TO WS-SHOWN
     MOVE WS-COUNT TO WS-SHOWN2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "pack.mcmeta" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 11 TO WS-NAME-LENGTH
     CALL "ZIP-FIND" USING WS-ZIP WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-INDEX
     CALL "ZIP-CRC-CHECK" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-ERROR
     MOVE "contract formats T15 Faithful pack.mcmeta is found and its CRC-32 matches the central record"
         TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "found 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-ERROR TO WS-SHOWN
     STRING "found " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     IF WS-INDEX = 0
         MOVE "absent" TO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "assets/minecraft/textures/block/stone.png" TO WS-NAME
     MOVE 41 TO WS-NAME-LENGTH
     CALL "ZIP-FIND" USING WS-ZIP WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-INDEX
     CALL "ZIP-CRC-CHECK" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-ERROR
     MOVE "contract formats T15 Faithful stone.png is found and its CRC-32 matches the central record"
         TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-ERROR TO WS-SHOWN
     STRING "found " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     IF WS-INDEX = 0
         MOVE "absent" TO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ZIP-READ-RANGE" USING WS-ZIP WS-INDEX WS-BIG WS-C1M WS-LENGTH WS-ERROR
     MOVE "contract formats T15 ZIP-READ-RANGE of stone.png: status 0 and the PNG signature" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "0 89504e47" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 4 TO WS-LENGTH
     CALL "TEST-HEX-OF" USING WS-BIG WS-LENGTH WS-HEX
     MOVE WS-ERROR TO WS-SHOWN
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOWN) " " WS-HEX(1:8) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ZIP-CLOSE" USING WS-ZIP
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM CONTRACT-FORMATS-PROVIDER.
 COPY FMTEST.
